<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $2  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $2  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were mostly steady, instances $1.00 to $2.00 per cwt higher on calves under 500 lbs, compared to last week's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers:  Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 71.50-75.75.</p>
<p>Medium and Large 2 400-500 lbs 80.50-84.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers:  Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs</p>
<p>65.50-73.50; 700-800 lbs 64.00-71.50; 800-900 lbs 60.00-63.00.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts: 1,600</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
